# Collibra Activity History — Sample Query

Query the [Collibra REST API](https://developer.collibra.com/rest/) to pull Activity History records.

## Endpoint

```
GET https://<instance-name>.collibra.com/rest/2.0/activities?resourceType=WorkflowInstance&limit=1000&sortField=timestamp&sortOrder=DESC
```

**Example** (replace `<instance-name>` with your own Collibra instance):

```
https://bailine-fed.collibra.com/rest/2.0/activities?resourceType=WorkflowInstance&limit=1000&sortField=timestamp&sortOrder=DESC
```

## Query Parameters

| Parameter | Description |
|---|---|
| `resourceType` | Filters activities by resource type (e.g., `WorkflowInstance`) |
| `limit` | Maximum number of results to return (up to 1000) |
| `sortField` | Field to sort results by (e.g., `timestamp`) |
| `sortOrder` | Sort direction — `ASC` or `DESC` |

## Fields Returned

| Field | Description |
|---|---|
| `id` | Unique identifier of the activity record |
| `timestamp` | Date/time the activity occurred |
| `user` | User who performed the activity |
| `activityType` | Type of activity (e.g., create, update, delete) |
| `cause` | What triggered the activity |
| `affectedName` | Name of the affected asset/object |
| `affectedType` | Type of the affected asset/object |
| `businessItemName` | Name of the related business item |
| `field` | Field that was changed |
| `oldValue` | Value before the change |
| `newValue` | Value after the change |
| `descriptionRaw` | Raw JSON payload / description of the activity |
